WEBVTT

00:37:29.665 --> 00:37:32.153
but it's a gift that some people
can use for good,

00:37:32.177 --> 00:37:33.542
some people can use for bad,

00:37:33.566 --> 00:37:35.926
but some people are clearly capable.

00:37:35.950 --> 00:37:37.331
And sort of --

00:37:37.355 --> 00:37:38.506
(Laughter)

00:37:38.530 --> 00:37:40.181
I'm just saying through history,

00:37:40.205 --> 00:37:44.705
we've seen these very magnanimous
characters and figures

00:37:44.729 --> 00:37:46.582
that have done remarkable things,

00:37:46.606 --> 00:37:49.610
and then some that seemed
like they were doing remarkable things

00:37:49.634 --> 00:37:51.109
until they weren't.

00:37:52.079 --> 00:37:57.739
And unfortunately,
many of us are susceptible to it.

00:37:57.763 --> 00:37:59.179
AG: Yeah.

00:37:59.203 --> 00:38:01.264
Well, I think this is one of the ways